      "title": {
        "en": "Healthy birds and socialised companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most customers express great satisfaction with the condition and temperament of their parrots, noting that birds arrive tame, healthy, and quick to settle in family homes. Hand-reared conures and caiques are frequently described as affectionate. However, isolated buyers reported serious issues including health complications or unstated physical defects."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful guidance and friendly service"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers praise store staff for providing detailed guidance on species selection, diet, and cage equipment without high-pressure sales tactics. First-time owners particularly appreciate the helpful advice shared by store assistants. Conversely, a minority of dissatisfied clients felt that post-purchase disputes were handled unhelpfully."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Delivery updates and dispute handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients who arranged courier delivery frequently praise the store for providing photo updates, transit tracking, and clear arrival notices throughout the journey. In contrast, reviewers dealing with complaints about injured birds or buy-back price agreements experienced frustrating communication and felt their concerns were dismissed."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
